<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικῠλινδέω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικυκλ-κυλίω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Plb.
			3.53.4
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			19.19
		</span></i>), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κυλίσω [ῑ</span>]:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll down upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρους ἐπί τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.5.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ὁδοιποροῦσι πέτρας</span>
			D.S.l.c., cf. Plb.l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τμήματα τοῦ πελάγους -ισθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.109
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκων τόκοις -κυλισθέντων</span>
			interest <i>being heaped on</i> interest, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.831e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σιτίον εἰς τὸν στόμαχον
				-ινδεῖσθαι</span>
			<i>is slipped into . . </i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				699c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ισθεῖσα</span>
			<i>overlaying</i> the infant, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>to</i>
			<i>be applied by rolling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς σαρξί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.757
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>degenerate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς χρόνια πάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					19.560
				</span></i>
			: metaph., [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοήσεις] δι᾽ ἀρρωστίαν
				-ούμεναι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ ἐπιτρέχουσαι τοῖς εἴδεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					88
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. intr.,
				<i>roll on</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματα</span> Ps. -<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
